<div class="meta">NOVA CORE: Protocol 51 · last updated October 10, 2026</div>

<h2>Playing the game</h2>
<ul>
  <li>NOVA CORE is free to play.</li>
  <li>Only runs played while signed in with X count for the global leaderboard. Each score is checked by our server before it appears.</li>
  <li>We may change, pause or end the game or the leaderboard at any time.</li>
  <li>NOVA CORE is not affiliated with, sponsored or endorsed by X Corp.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Giveaway</h2>
<ol>
  <li><b>Prizes:</b> $5 for 1st place, $5 for 2nd place, $5 for 3rd place ($15 total prize pool in crypto).</li>
  <li><b>Winners:</b> the top 3 X accounts on the verified leaderboard at October 17, 2026, 17:00 ICT (10:00 UTC). Each X account counts once, with its best accepted run. If two scores are equal, the one set first ranks higher.</li>
  <li><b>Who can enter:</b> anyone aged 16 or older where giveaways like this are allowed. The project organizers are excluded from winning prizes.</li>
  <li><b>One person, one X account.</b> Using several accounts, bots or scripts, a modified game, bugs or exploits, or sending fake scores leads to disqualification. We can remove any score we believe was not played fairly.</li>
  <li><b>Checking winners:</b> before a prize is handed out we review the top runs. We may ask a winner to show proof of play, for example a screen recording of a run.</li>
  <li><b>Contact:</b> winners are messaged on X by @SupernovaLPad and must reply within 3 days. Otherwise the prize goes to the next place.</li>
  <li><b>Delivery:</b> prizes are sent in crypto to a wallet address provided by the winner within 3 days of the winner replying.</li>
</ol>

<p class="warn">We will <b>never</b> ask you for a password, a seed phrase or a payment to receive a prize. Only messages from @SupernovaLPad are real.</p>

